  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisquit.host%252fen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8a071a84cf75714bde606769f94930a500df439c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1100\" height=\"234\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/29d823752797c8ddecba3d47fc53c53ad26232f1_0.webp\" alt=\"橫幅\" width=\"2000\" height=\"500\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/69d504f0a55f35dfc760c75424668d9a6ba20bac_0.webp\" width=\"840\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>配置鍵值對，以便捷掌控玩家的發展進度。</li>\n<li>針對同類型任務提供帶有鍵值對的獎勵。</li>\n<li>於指令獎勵中，新增可從控制台執行指令的額外選項。</li>\n<li>支援將計時器設定為任務（1.20.1）。</li>\n<li>操作簡便。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/78a9a0fac26eb19765db7ac27ae41eadc6979edf_0.webp\" width=\"840\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>為數值集合建立任務，適用於需要完成不同類別任務的漸進式任務。</li>\n<li>建立每日與每週任務，讓您能持續獲取資源。</li>\n<li>使用控制台指令來驅動部分模組與外掛。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/195360eede0cac8ce72e948cf204b1dcc656b6c6_0.webp\" width=\"840\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-quests-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e8bd5b8cfee72d8a7fecfabe8752e230c75a5fa2.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fextralib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7797661bf0defeb0d3eb387785d7f3e43ef341bc_0.webp\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p>",
